## Why This Question Matters
Provides a practical, beginner-friendly approach to assessing grounding, code fidelity, and relevance for a developer assistant across private documentation corpora with versioning support.

## Key Concepts
- Grounding responses to exact doc version and section
- Detection of code block hallucinations
- Metrics: precision@1, grounding coverage, and citation drift

## Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal runner skeleton
const prompts = loadPrompts('prompts-50.json');
prompts.forEach(p => {
  const ans = model.ask(p);
  const grounded = verifyGrounding(ans, p.docVersion, p.section);
  const hallucinated = detectHallucinations(ans, p.docVersion);

  console.log(JSON.stringify({
    prompt: p.question,
    grounded,
    hallucinated,
    precisionAt1: computePrecision(ans, p.expectedEndpoints)
  }));
});
```

